          "body": "Machine-readable output drops the process exit code, so wrappers always report success.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Run `kit check --json` against a broken project\n2. Inspect the JSON: no `exitCode` key\n\nExpected behavior: the JSON document includes `exitCode` next to `status`.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- [ ] Emit `exitCode` in `kit/cli/output.py`\n- [ ] Cover it in the CLI tests"
